I’d love the idea of turning my teenagers’ study hours into actual rewards, especially since we’re already scraping together every rand in Clermont to cover school fees and uniforms for our four kids. But with my municipal administration salary fixed at R10,000 a month, that extra R50 directly competes with prepaid electricity and scholar transport, so I can’t honestly justify it without proof it lifts their marks or reduces our existing education expenses. I’d reconsider if you offered a free trial that shows measurable grade improvement or a family bundle that doesn’t force me to choose between your subscription and next month’s grocery budget.
