The idea of earning cash for studying sounds tempting, but with my aunt and me surviving on R5,000 a month, that recurring R50 would rather go toward food and safe transport when the broken streetlights make the darkness dangerous after sunset. I genuinely want better resources for my Grade 10 subjects, but I can’t justify a monthly fee that competes with the essentials that keep us secure. I would only reconsider if Thuto.io offered a free tier or let me pay once per term instead of monthly so we can manage our tight budget without compromising my safety.

